      "content": "that's pretty bold advice. so you're saying we shouldn't even try to bridge the gap or explain the reasoning to them? i just worry that if we're too aggressive and call their concerns \"outdated,\" it might actually create more resentment and make the workplace more tense instead of better. wouldn't a more balanced explanation help keep the peace?",
